      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "**[P-015] Hướng dẫn Quickstart Local & AI Log (Pre-push)**\n\nChào team \uD83D\uDC4B, base setup cho P-015 (FastAPI + LangGraph, Python 3.13) đã xong. Các bạn làm theo checklist bên dưới để chạy local và bật pre-push hook nhé.\n\n---\n### \uD83D\uDCCB Checklist\n- [ ] Copy `.env.example` → `.env` (điền API Keys)\n- [ ] Install deps: `python -m pip install -r requirements.txt`\n- [ ] Test local: `python -m pytest -q` (6/6 pass)\n- [ ] Run server & test endpoint chat\n- [ ] Setup pre-push hook (Windows)\n- [ ] Test AI log: `python scripts/submit_log.py`\n\n---\n### \uD83D\uDCBB Lệnh PowerShell (Copy-paste)\n\n1️⃣ **Tạo file .env & cài thư viện:**\n```powershell\nCopy-Item .env.example .env -Force\npython -m pip install -r requirements.txt\n```\n\n2️⃣ **Chạy Test & Khởi chạy Server (từ Repo Root):**\n```powershell\npython -m pytest -q\n$env:PYTHONPATH=(Get-Location).Path\npython -m uvicorn src.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000\n```\n\n3️⃣ **Test Chat Endpoint:**\n```powershell\n$body = @{ message = 'Xin chao' } | ConvertTo-Json\nInvoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri '[http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat](http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat)' -ContentType 'application/json' -Body $body\n```\n\n4️⃣ **Cài Git Hook AI Log (Windows):**\n```powershell\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\scripts\\setup_hooks.ps1\n```\n\n---\n### \uD83D\uDEE0️ FAQ — Fix lỗi nhanh\n\n\uD83D\uDEA8 **1. `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'src'`**\n\uD83D\uDC49 Set `PYTHONPATH` trước khi uvicorn: `$env:PYTHONPATH=(Get-Location).Path`\n\n\uD83D\uDEA8 **2. Lỗi `cannot spawn .git/hooks/pre-push` hoặc WSL**\n\uD83D\uDC49 Dùng PowerShell chạy: `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\scripts\\setup_hooks.ps1`\n\n\uD83D\uDEA8 **3. `submit_log.py` báo `No logs to submit`**\n\uD83D\uDC49 Do `.ai-log/session.jsonl` đang rỗng, cần tương tác qua Antigravity/Gemini để sinh log hoặc add entry mẫu.",
